end Mamimi is waiting. There, they’ve arranged to receive a hand-me-down school uniform for Makina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wm3JQFnhzWOUv6VYjiTCCEHznJk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"E così, Makina si procura una divisa.","synopsis":"Eita Akutsu begins living together with Makina Agatsuma to help her maintain a normal life without revealing her true identity. Carefully avoiding the watchful eyes of their landlady, the two head to a park where Eita’s close friend Mamimi is waiting. There, they’ve arranged to receive a hand-me-down school uniform for Makina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wm3JQFnhzWOUv6VYjiTCCEHznJk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"E così, Makina riesce a celare il segreto.","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18621","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"177509","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58833","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"254174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"449914","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"95992","synopsis":"Having returned to school life, Makina slips on a banana peel and falls. Eita can’t stop worrying that her malfunctioning left leg might fall off at any moment. Seeing his anxious behavior, Mamimi becomes convinced that he must be a dangerous stalker targeting Makina…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ufr0moywgnd0CnqUmrXxfpFDUXg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"E così, Makina riesce a celare il segreto.","synopsis":"Having returned to school life, Makina slips on a banana peel and falls. Eita can’t stop worrying that her malfunctioning left leg might fall off at any moment. Seeing his anxious behavior, Mamimi becomes convinced that he must be a dangerous stalker targeting Makina…","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w30